## 16. Test Scenarios

| # | Scenario | Expected Result |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | ELD date changes for a loan with an existing **open** DIR item | Existing item is updated (ELD date, SLA/reporting due date, Load/Date-Added); no duplicate created |
