| 6 | The batch runs twice in succession with no underlying data change | No duplicate items created on the second run |
| 7 | DMU and TSP processing for the same loans, before and after this change | Behavior unchanged (regression check) |
| 8 | Two of ELD0/ELDH/ELDX tie on the oldest date | `ELDH` wins over `ELDX` over `ELD0` |

